\p{Do we transcribe Koudenburg's \em{augmented} axioms literally, or the Cruttwell–Shulman axioms plus his augmentation as a separate structure? Default: literal transcription, then a theorem that it restricts to Cruttwell–Shulman on the unaugmented part.}
\p{\em{Resolution:} open. Decided by the human; record the answer as a decision node that this node then cites.}
